1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:04,249
Primata berbisa ini dikira
punah hampir 100 tahun...

2
00:00:04,249 --> 00:00:05,472
Ternyata,

3
00:00:05,472 --> 00:00:08,015
selama ini ia keluar-masuk kebun warga.

4
00:00:08,015 --> 00:00:10,019
Namanya kukang Bangka.

5
00:00:10,019 --> 00:00:12,803
Catatan ilmiah terakhirnya
dari zaman Belanda.

6
00:00:12,803 --> 00:00:14,181
10 tahun terakhir,

7
00:00:14,181 --> 00:00:16,724
sekitar 90 ekor diselamatkan...

8
00:00:16,724 --> 00:00:18,593
beberapa kesetrum kabel listrik.

9
00:00:18,593 --> 00:00:21,830
Hutannya terus berubah jadi
tambang timah dan sawit.

10
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:23,507
Kini ilmuwan memastikan:

11
00:00:23,507 --> 00:00:24,817
ia masih ada!

12
00:00:24,817 --> 00:00:27,360
86 ekor kembali ke hutan.

13
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,465
Di daerahmu...

14
00:00:28,465 --> 00:00:29,941
masih ada kukang?
